  "instructions": [
    "Heat 2 tablespoons of ghee in a kadhai over medium-high heat.",
    "Add onion, garlic, and ginger, and sauté till onion turns golden brown.",
    "Add turmeric, cumin, and coriander, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add fish stock, and bring to a boil.",
    "Add cod fillets, and cook for 8 minutes or till they are cooked through.",
    "Remove fish fillets from the kadhai, and keep aside.",
    "Add red wine vinegar to the kadhai, and deglaze the pan.",
    "Simmer the sauce for 2 minutes, and adjust seasoning.",
    "Add crunchy onions for garnish.",
    "Serve hot with a side of rice or roti.",
    "Garnish with cilantro, if desired."
